{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world inhabited by vegetable-folk and animal-folk, Oil-Water-ism has come to an end. You are the \u201clucky one,\u201d chosen to cook for the Gods. Will you dedicate yourself to serving these noble deities, or secretly work to liberate the oppressed people sealed within the orbital city? The choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/4ba7feba8265325e82f24546f800e0d3.poster.avif?t=1767821235\" width=674 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/4ba7feba8265325e82f24546f800e0d3.webm?t=1767821235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock kitchenware, cook a wide variety of challenging recipes, and serve dish after dish to the \u201cGods.\u201d Be careful\u2014if guests lose patience or you make them angry, they will attack your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/3ed7a351769fda11792fa0800c693414.poster.avif?t=1767821235\" width=674 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/3ed7a351769fda11792fa0800c693414.webm?t=1767821235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and expand your base, upgrade production lines, and decorate your kitchen\u2014create a stylish and efficient space restaurant to meet the Gods\u2019 ever-demanding standards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/15b2d5e07f066f5f675a5102d84394b7.poster.avif?t=1767821235\" width=674 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/15b2d5e07f066f5f675a5102d84394b7.webm?t=1767821235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When guests attack your restaurant, the law allows you to strike back. Defeat them, secretly harvest their brains, and use them to create highly efficient robotic staff. These robots can carry coins, take orders, serve dishes, cook meals, and even fight alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/d89d6887cc5472e4e611fdd7a8ba039a.poster.avif?t=1767821235\" width=674 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/d89d6887cc5472e4e611fdd7a8ba039a.webm?t=1767821235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space cockroaches will swarm into your kitchen. Keep it clean, or they\u2019ll steal exposed food and attack your defenses. Build towers, walls, and medics to protect your kitchen. And when you run out of ingredients but happen to collect enough cockroach corpses, you can secretly disguise them as food ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/2a27bdae026c1d3279d3e92d35730638.poster.avif?t=1767821235\" width=674 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/2a27bdae026c1d3279d3e92d35730638.webm?t=1767821235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase TVs and broadcast commercials to brainwash the Gods. Boost the sales of specific dishes and massively increase your profits. For example, you can double the price of all vegetables\u2014then trick the Gods into buying them in bulk, raking in huge earnings.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746950?t=1767821235","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746950?t=1767821235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/df2b8951e26ec4c905654582c749133752a0347e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767821235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/df2b8951e26ec4c905654582c749133752a0347e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767821235","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746950/extras/015b7dac977325daebe46aa6ec1a6bb5.avif?t=1767821235\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world inhabited by vegetable-folk and animal-folk, Oil-Water-ism has come to an end. You are the \u201clucky one,\u201d chosen to cook for the Gods. Will you dedicate yourself to serving these noble 